graph LR
    NemoGR["NeMo-Guardrails<br/>Server"]

    %% Runtime Framework
    NemoGR -->|web framework| FastAPI["FastAPI >=0.103.0"]
    NemoGR -->|ASGI server| Uvicorn["Uvicorn >=0.23"]
    NemoGR -->|web toolkit| Starlette["Starlette >=0.49.1"]

    %% LLM / AI Libraries
    NemoGR -->|LLM SDK| OpenAI["OpenAI SDK >=1.0.0"]
    NemoGR -->|embeddings| AzureOpenAI["Azure OpenAI SDK"]
    NemoGR -->|ML framework| Torch["PyTorch >=2.0.0"]
    NemoGR -->|NLP models| Transformers["Transformers >=4.35.0"]
    NemoGR -->|NLP pipeline| SpaCy["spaCy >=3.4.4"]
    NemoGR -->|embeddings| SentenceTransformers["sentence-transformers >=2.2.0"]
    NemoGR -->|embeddings| FastEmbed["fastembed >=0.2.2"]

    %% Guardrail Libraries
    NemoGR -->|PII detection| Presidio["Presidio >=2.2"]
    NemoGR -->|LLM chains| LangChainOpenAI["langchain-openai >=0.1.0"]
    NemoGR -->|malware patterns| YaraPython["yara-python >=4.5.1"]

    %% Observability
    NemoGR -->|tracing| OTelAPI["OpenTelemetry API >=1.27.0"]
    NemoGR -->|metrics| OTelSDK["OpenTelemetry SDK"]
    NemoGR -->|export| OTelExporter["OTLP Exporter"]
    NemoGR -->|FastAPI instr| OTelFastAPI["OTel FastAPI Instrumentation"]

    %% Data / Compute
    NemoGR -->|arrays| NumPy["NumPy >=1.21"]
    NemoGR -->|data frames| Pandas["Pandas >=1.4.0"]
    NemoGR -->|ML utils| ScikitLearn["scikit-learn"]
    NemoGR -->|inference| ONNX["onnxruntime >=1.17.0"]

    %% Network / HTTP
    NemoGR -->|async HTTP| HTTPX["httpx >=0.24.1"]
    NemoGR -->|async HTTP| AioHTTP["aiohttp >=3.10.11"]
    NemoGR -->|gRPC| gRPC["grpcio"]
    NemoGR -->|crypto| Cryptography["cryptography ==46.0.7"]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    NemoGR ==>|proxies requests to| LLMService["LLM Inference Service<br/>(Internal Platform)"]

    %% External Service Integrations
    NemoGR -->|inference| AzureOAI["Azure OpenAI<br/>HTTPS/443"]
    NemoGR -->|inference| OpenAIAPI["OpenAI API<br/>HTTPS"]

